sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Student
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Api as AssignmentController
  participant Service as AssignmentService
  participant File as FileAssetService
  participant Repo as AssignmentSubmissionRepository
  participant Notify as NotificationService

  Student->>Web: Upload assignment
  Web->>Api: POST /api/v1/assignments/{assignmentId}/submissions
  Api->>Service: submitAssignment(studentId, assignmentId, file)
  Service->>Service: Validate enrollment, deadline and file policy
  Service->>File: Store file metadata and storage key
  Service->>Repo: Save submission
  Service->>Notify: Notify instructor
  Service-->>Api: AssignmentSubmissionResponse
  Api-->>Web: 201 Created
  Web-->>Student: Show submitted state
